## 4️⃣  Testing & Launch

| Task | Rough Time | Who |
|------|------------|-----|
| Create table & policies | 15 min | DBA / Dev |
| Write & deploy Edge Function | 30–45 min | Dev |
| Add chat widget & Linux | 30 min | Front‑end dev |
| Manual test (book, view, double‑book) | 20 min | QA |
| Deploy to production | 5 min | DevOps |

